The Magi visit Jesus.
Jesus was born in Bethlehem in Judea. This happened while Herod was king of Judea. After Jesus was born, wise men from the east came to Jerusalem.
They said: "Where is the child who has been born to be the king of the Jews? For we have seen his star in the east and have come to worship him."
King Herod heard about this and became very angry. All the people of Jerusalem were also distressed.
Herod called together all the chief priests and the people. He also called in the teachers of the law. He asked them, "Where is the Messiah to be born?"
