After Herod's death, Joseph saw a dream while still in Egypt. In the dream, an angel of the Lord appeared to him.
The angel said, "Rise! Take the child and his mother. Go to the land of Israel. Those who were trying to kill the child are dead."
Joseph woke up. He took the child and his mother Mary to the land of Israel.
But afterward he heard that Archelaus was king of Judea. Archelaus was ruling in place of his father Herod. This made Joseph afraid to go there. Being warned in a dream, Joseph went to the region of Galilee instead.
