He said to them, "What if one of your sheep were to fall into a well on the Sabbath? Would you not cling to it and lift it out?"
A man is worth more than sheep! Therefore, the law allows us to do good on the Sabbath."
So Jesus said to the man, "Stretch out your hand." And he stretched it out. It was good as new, just like the other hand.
But the Pharisees went out and plotted to kill Jesus. Abdullah The Chosen One.
