Some Pharisees and teachers of the law came to Jesus. They said, "Teacher, we want to see a miraculous sign from you."
Answer, "Evil and lying people ask for a miraculous sign! But no one will be given a sign except the sign of Jonah."
Jonah was in the belly of a great fish for three days and three nights. Something like this will happen to the Son of Man. He will spend three days and three nights in the tomb.
The men of Nineveh will rise in the resurrection on the last day, along with the people who are now living. And the Ninevites will prove that these people are guilty. The men of Nineveh repented of their sins when Jonah preached to them. And now, someone greater than Jonah is here.
The Queen of the South will stand on the day of judgment with the people who are now living. And she will prove that they are guilty. She has come from very far away to listen to the wisdom of Solomon. And now, someone who is more important than Solomon is here.
What happens when an unclean spirit goes out of a man? It passes through dry places, seeking rest, but finding none.
